{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "12a0245c-d492-89b1-8e52-2989afbcc703",
  "created_at": "2026-01-05T12:17:07-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Luis Silva",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:15:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:15:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, honey. Um, I've got a question about the Christmas tree. I'm on speaker, I've got my hands full of pine needles here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:15:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, no problem. You want to know about getting the tree picked up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:16:03-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, dear. Is there a pickup for them still, now that it's the fifth? We kept it up a little long, my stepbrother is crashing on the couch until January and he likes the lights."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:16:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Yes, we do collect trees curbside in the first part of January. Do you know whether yours has any tinsel or a stand on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:16:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, it's bare. Lights are off, ornaments are in the box. Is there a fee for that, though?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:16:31-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, there's no charge for the regular tree pickup. Just put it out at the curb, no bag around it. What's the address, so I can note it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:16:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 470 Kay Street, up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:16:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four seventy Kay Street. Got it. Just set it out by the curb, not in the street, and the crew will get it on their route."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:16:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful. And no bag, curbside, no charge. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:16:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it exactly right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:17:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, dear. You have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:17:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
